# "At the beginning of your end step, if you have the initiative" (CR 603.4, 725): Bot1 takes the initiative on turn 1 and makes
# a Faerie Dragon at its end step. On turn 2 Bot2 casts its own Feywild Caretaker and takes the initiative from Bot1 (CR 725.2),
# making its own Dragon at its end step; on turn 3 Bot1 no longer has the initiative, so its end step makes nothing, and
# Bot1's Dragon count stays at one while Bot2 holds it. (The turn 1 and turn 2 sequences are the existing scenario's: an Island, three
# Moxen and a Sol Ring, with the venture into Undercity fetching a Forest.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Feywild Caretaker
Island
Forest
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Feywild Caretaker
Island
Forest
Island x11

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Feywild Caretaker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Search(Forest)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Feywild Caretaker.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Search(Island)
? Initiative = Bot2
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]
? Initiative = Bot2

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 7
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 7
Initiative = Bot2
Bot1.Battlefield.Faerie Dragon Token.Power = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Faerie Dragon Token.Power = 1
